#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x528d86/0x000000
msgid "...Just up the voltage... Kill me..."
msgstr "……把电压调高就是了……杀了我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x928d8b/0x000000
msgid "...OK... All right... the truth..."
msgstr "...OK... 好吧... 真相..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000000
msgid "I'll grant you that."
msgstr "这我承认。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000001
msgid ""
"But your silence was exactly \n"
"the answer I needed."
msgstr ""
"但你的沉默\n"
"正是我需要的答案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000002
msgid "Ten years ago, your mission was to kill her. "
msgstr "十年前，你的任务是杀了她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000003
msgid "And her mission was to be killed by you."
msgstr "她的任务，是死在你手上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000000
msgid "Crops and fish will die, "
msgstr "庄稼和鱼都会死，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000001
msgid ""
"leaving plenty of free hands to help us\n"
"mass-produce Peace Walker."
msgstr ""
"正好腾出大量人手帮我们\n"
"量产和平行者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000002
msgid "Oho... and wouldn't you know, "
msgstr "哦豁... 你猜怎么着，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000003
msgid ""
"someone's gone and built a pesky little \n"
"fortress there. Now who would do that?"
msgstr ""
"有人偏偏在那儿修了座\n"
"碍事的小要塞。会是谁呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000004
msgid "And right in the middle of the target zone, too. "
msgstr "而且还正好在目标区正中央。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000005
msgid ""
"Oh well. All the better to test the warheads' CEP\n"
"(circular error probability)."
msgstr ""
"也罢。正好用来测试弹头的CEP\n"
"（圆概率误差）。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000006
msgid "You bastard..."
msgstr "你这混蛋..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000000
msgid "It's too late, Big Boss."
msgstr "太迟了，BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000000
msgid "Snake..."
msgstr "SNAKE..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000000
msgid "Paz...!"
msgstr "帕兹...！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000003
msgid ""
"At last I found her. The culprit \n"
"who led you here to begin with."
msgstr ""
"终于找到她了。最初\n"
"把你引到这里的罪魁祸首。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000004
msgid ""
"Should have taken care of her back \n"
"at the supply facility."
msgstr ""
"当初在补给设施\n"
"就该把她解决掉。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000005
msgid "Snake, don't..."
msgstr "SNAKE，别..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000006
msgid ""
"The Mammal Pod is finished.\n"
"Peace Walker's activation sequence is complete."
msgstr ""
"哺乳舱已完成。\n"
"和平行者的启动程序完毕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000007
msgid "Finished...?"
msgstr "完成...？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000008
msgid "With The Boss, you were loyal to the end, "
msgstr "对THE BOSS，你忠诚到了最后，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000000
msgid "And the Peace Walker Project is the key."
msgstr "而和平行者计划就是关键。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000001
msgid ""
"The advent of Peace Walker will bring calm\n"
"to this restless world."
msgstr ""
"和平行者问世，将给这个\n"
"动荡世界带来安宁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000002
msgid ""
"Don't you see, Snake? We need nukes -\n"
"controlled nukes - to have peace."
msgstr ""
"你还不明白吗，SNAKE？我们需要核武——\n"
"受控的核武——才能换来和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000003
msgid "Lies!"
msgstr "胡说！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000004
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will restore order - \n"
"order in the form of a new Cold War."
msgstr ""
"和平行者将恢复秩序——\n"
"以新冷战的形式。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000005
msgid ""
"But if the world is to understand \n"
"the genius of our plan, we must launch."
msgstr ""
"但要让世界理解\n"
"我们计划的精妙，必须发射。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x528f95/0x000000
msgid "She fulfilled her duty to America to the very end."
msgstr "她为美国尽忠到了最后一刻。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x528f95/0x000001
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, Snake, \n"
"the final missing piece is now in place."
msgstr ""
"多亏了你，SNAKE，\n"
"最后一块拼图就位了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000000
msgid "I wonder who'll miss a ragtag band of pirates "
msgstr "谁会惦记一群乌合之众的海盗"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000001
msgid "all the way out in the middle of the Caribbean...?"
msgstr "远在加勒比海中央……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000002
msgid "But first..."
msgstr "但首先……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000003
msgid "We're going to prove to the White House "
msgstr "我们要向白宫证明"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000004
msgid ""
"that our baby can travel \n"
"the Caribbean coast on its own."
msgstr ""
"我们的孩子能独自\n"
"航行加勒比海岸。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000005
msgid ""
"The whole world will know of \n"
"Peace Walker's versatility."
msgstr ""
"全世界都将知道\n"
"和平行者的多面性。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000006
msgid ""
"They'll witness the birth of a deterrent\n"
"that can penetrate both communist "
msgstr ""
"他们将见证一种威慑力量的诞生\n"
"它能穿透共产主义"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000007
msgid ""
"and guerilla-controlled territory,\n"
"traverse any kind of terrain..."
msgstr ""
"和游击队控制的领土，\n"
"穿越任何地形……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000008
msgid "And deliver a nuke anywhere it needs to go. "
msgstr "并将核弹送达任何需要的地方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000009
msgid "Untouchable. Unstoppable. The perfect deterrent. "
msgstr "无法触及。无法阻挡。完美的威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000a
msgid "The Cold War's days are numbered. "
msgstr "冷战的日子屈指可数了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000b
msgid ""
"Deterrence isn't only about \n"
"America and Russia now."
msgstr ""
"威慑如今不只关乎\n"
"美国和苏联。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000c
msgid ""
"You know what? You're absolutely right.\n"
"While we've been wringing our hands, "
msgstr ""
"你知道吗？你说得完全对。\n"
"当我们还在束手无策时，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000d
msgid "China, France - even India - have surpassed us. "
msgstr "中国、法国——甚至印度——都超越了我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000e
msgid ""
"There's a free-for-all nuclear arms race brewing\n"
"just below the surface."
msgstr ""
"一场无限制的核军备竞赛\n"
"正在暗流涌动。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000f
msgid "The nuclear threat will only spread,"
msgstr "核威胁只会扩散，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000010
msgid ""
"which is exactly why we must deter it \n"
"here and now."
msgstr ""
"正因如此，我们必须在此刻\n"
"加以威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000000
msgid ""
"And thus The Boss is restored to life\n"
"as the Mammal Pod. I thank you."
msgstr ""
"于是THE BOSS以哺乳舱之姿\n"
"重获新生。谢谢你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000001
msgid "Restored to life...?"
msgstr "复活了……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000002
msgid "You're crazy."
msgstr "你疯了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000003
msgid "I'll let you in on a little secret, Big Boss. "
msgstr "让我告诉你一个小秘密，BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000004
msgid ""
"You see, I've already selected \n"
"Peace Walker's initial target."
msgstr ""
"你看，我已经选好了\n"
"和平行者的首个目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000005
msgid "An offshore area in the Caribbean."
msgstr "加勒比的一处近海区域。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000006
msgid ""
"The trade winds will scatter the fallout\n"
"all over the surrounding region."
msgstr ""
"信风会把放射性尘埃\n"
"吹散到周边整个地区。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x928ff5/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000016
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x902c9e/0x000000
msgid "Snake!"
msgstr "SNAKE"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x928ff5/0x000001
msgid "Stop them, Snake! Don't let 'em get away!"
msgstr "拦住他们，SNAKE！别放跑！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000000
msgid "There it is! It's still in range!"
msgstr "在那儿！还在射程内！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000001
msgid "Peace Walker's estimated top speed on level terrain is 25 miles an hour."
msgstr "和平行者在平地上的最高时速估计为25英里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000002
msgid "C'mon, I'll bet you can do at least 30."
msgstr "来吧，我打赌你至少能跑30。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000003
msgid "Paz is on board the Hind, too. "
msgstr "帕兹也在那架雌鹿上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000004
msgid "I noticed that."
msgstr "我注意到了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000005
msgid "She's our client. We have to protect her."
msgstr "她是委托人，得保护她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000006
msgid "Snake, don't let Peace Walker get away!"
msgstr "SNAKE，别让和平行者跑了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000007
msgid "The day is dawning... "
msgstr "天亮了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000008
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6269fd/0x000000
msgid "Go!"
msgstr "上！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000000
msgid "Approaching the border. "
msgstr "接近边境了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000001
msgid "See you around, Big Boss."
msgstr "回头见，BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000002
msgid "Holy... Look at that! "
msgstr "天哪，看那！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000003
msgid "Snake, that's the border up ahead! "
msgstr "SNAKE，前面就是边境！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x329070/0x000000
msgid "Snake, you're entering the woods. Watch out!"
msgstr "SNAKE，你要进树林了。小心！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000000
msgid "Peace Walker's getting away!"
msgstr "和平行者要跑了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000001
msgid "Faster! We're losing sight of it!"
msgstr "再快点！快看不见它了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000002
msgid "Hit the <I=△> button as fast as you can!"
msgstr "尽快连按<I=△>键！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000003
msgid "You're about to lose Peace Walker!"
msgstr "你快要跟丢和平行者了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ed/0x399132/0x000000
msgid "Hang in there...!"
msgstr "撑住……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ed/0x399132/0x000001
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006338
msgid "Dammit..."
msgstr "该死"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000000
msgid "Take the gondola west along the river."
msgstr "沿河乘缆车向西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000001
msgid ""
"When you reach the northern bank, \n"
"you are in Nicaragua."
msgstr ""
"到达北岸后，\n"
"你就身处尼加拉瓜了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000002
msgid "I've arranged for a guide to get you close."
msgstr "我已安排向导带你接近。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000003
msgid "Snake... "
msgstr "SNAKE…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000004
msgid "Chico?"
msgstr "奇科？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000005
msgid "Sorry about the horse. It sure was pretty."
msgstr "抱歉弄丢了你的马。它真漂亮。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000006
msgid "Life's end... Isn't it beautiful?"
msgstr "生命的终结……不美吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000007
msgid "It's almost tragic."
msgstr "近乎悲惨。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000000
msgid "I've been waiting, Snake, for a long time."
msgstr "我一直在等，SNAKE，等了很久。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000002
msgid "There is nothing more for me to give you."
msgstr "我已没有什么能给你了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000003
msgid ""
"All that's left for you to take is my life.\n"
"...By your own hand."
msgstr ""
"你能拿走的只剩我命。\n"
"……你亲手来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000000
msgid ""
"...And that one of their own \n"
"would have to do the job."
msgstr ""
"……而且必须由自己人\n"
"来动手。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000001
msgid ""
"The Boss wouldn't be allowed \n"
"to come back home alive. "
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS 不被允许\n"
"活着回国。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000002
msgid "And she wouldn't be allowed to kill herself."
msgstr "也不被允许自杀。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000000
msgid "One must die and one must live."
msgstr "一人死，一人活。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000001
msgid "No victory, no defeat."
msgstr "无胜，无败。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000002
msgid "The survivor will carry on the fight."
msgstr "幸存者将继续战斗。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000003
msgid "The one who survives will inherit the title of Boss."
msgstr "活下来的人将继承 BOSS 之名。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000004
msgid "Kill me..."
msgstr "杀我…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000005
msgid "Kill me now..."
msgstr "杀我吧…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000000
msgid ""
"Her life would be ended by \n"
"her most beloved disciple..."
msgstr ""
"她的生命将由\n"
"她最心爱的弟子终结……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000001
msgid "That was the way that the government wanted it."
msgstr "这正是政府的意图。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000002
msgid "That was the mission she was given."
msgstr "这就是她接到的任务。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000003
msgid "The taint of disgrace will follow her to her grave."
msgstr "耻辱的污名将随她入土。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929216/0x000000
msgid "There's only room for one Boss..."
msgstr "BOSS 只能有一个……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929216/0x000001
msgid "And one Snake..."
msgstr "还有一条蛇……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000000
msgid "Future generations will revile her."
msgstr "后世将会唾骂她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000001
msgid ""
"In America, as a despicable traitor \n"
"with no sense of honor..."
msgstr ""
"在美国，她是个毫无荣誉感的\n"
"卑鄙叛徒……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000002
msgid ""
"And in Russia, as a monster who unleashed\n"
"a nuclear catastrophe..."
msgstr ""
"而在俄国，她是个引发\n"
"核灾难的怪物……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000003
msgid ""
"She will go down in official history \n"
"as a war criminal."
msgstr ""
"官方历史将把她记载为\n"
"一名战犯。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000004
msgid "That... "
msgstr "那……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000005
msgid "was her final mission."
msgstr "是她最后任务。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000000
msgid ""
"The Boss' defection was a ruse set up\n"
"by the US government."
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS的叛逃是美国政府\n"
"设下的圈套。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000001
msgid ""
"But then something happened that \n"
"no one could have predicted."
msgstr ""
"但随后发生了\n"
"无人能预料的事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000002
msgid ""
"Colonel Volgin fired an American-made\n"
"nuclear warhead "
msgstr ""
"沃尔金上校发射了美国制\n"
"核弹头，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000003
msgid "at Sokolov's research facility."
msgstr "目标是索科洛夫设施。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000004
msgid ""
"So the operation itself was greatly \n"
"expanded and revised."
msgstr ""
"于是行动本身被大幅\n"
"扩大和修改。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000005
msgid ""
"The authorities in Washington knew that \n"
"in order to prove their innocence "
msgstr ""
"华盛顿当局知道，\n"
"为了证明自己的清白，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000006
msgid "they'd have to get rid of The Boss..."
msgstr "他们必须除掉THE BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000000
msgid ""
"They've been taken to safety.\n"
"We can't involve them in this any further."
msgstr ""
"他们已被转移到安全地点。\n"
"不能再把他们卷进来了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000001
msgid "Good."
msgstr "很好。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000002
msgid "They've got their own cause to fight for."
msgstr "他们有自己的仗要打。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000003
msgid ""
"And Snake... \n"
"Don't forget the bad guys've got Paz."
msgstr ""
"还有，SNAKE……\n"
"别忘了坏人有帕兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000004
msgid "I won't."
msgstr "我不会忘。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000005
msgid "We're prepping a few backup units. "
msgstr "我们在备几台备用机。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000006
msgid ""
"Don't let 'em launch, Snake. \n"
"We're counting on you!"
msgstr ""
"别让他们发射，SNAKE。\n"
"全靠你了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000000
msgid "Snake, history will never know what she did."
msgstr "SNAKE，历史永不知她做了什么。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000001
msgid "No one will ever learn the truth."
msgstr "没人会知道真相。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000002
msgid "Her story... her debriefing..."
msgstr "她的故事……她的汇报……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000003
msgid "...will endure only in your heart."
msgstr "……只会在你心中长存。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000004
msgid "Everything she did, she did for her country."
msgstr "她所做的一切，都是为了祖国。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000005
msgid ""
"She sacrificed her life and her honor \n"
"for her native land."
msgstr ""
"她为了祖国\n"
"牺牲了自己的生命和荣誉。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000006
msgid "She was a real hero."
msgstr "她是真英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000007
msgid "She was a true patriot."
msgstr "她是真爱国者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000000
msgid "Something's not right..."
msgstr "有点不对劲……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000001
msgid "Gate guard doesn't look too bad... "
msgstr "门卫看起来不算太强……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000002
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr "你觉得呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000003
msgid "Gonna need some help."
msgstr "得找人帮忙。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000000
msgid "This is Snake. Can you hear me?"
msgstr "我是SNAKE。能听到吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000001
msgid "This is Miller. Loud and clear."
msgstr "我是米勒。非常清楚。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000002
msgid "Got in without a hitch."
msgstr "顺利进来了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000003
msgid ""
"Good, there's an airfield on \n"
"the other side of the building -"
msgstr ""
"很好，建筑的另一边\n"
"有个机场——"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000004
msgid ""
"on the northwestern shore of the lake.\n"
"That's where they'll conduct the launch."
msgstr ""
"在湖的西北岸。\n"
"他们会在那里进行发射。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000005
msgid ""
"There's a communications tower \n"
"in front of you."
msgstr ""
"你前方\n"
"有一座通讯塔。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000006
msgid ""
"I'm betting they'll control \n"
"Peace Walker from there."
msgstr ""
"我猜他们会从那里\n"
"操控和平行者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000007
msgid ""
"Kaz, they're targeting Mother Base.\n"
"Don't you think you should evacuate?"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，他们的目标是母基地。\n"
"你不觉得该疏散吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000008
msgid "Nah... Everybody here believes in you, Boss."
msgstr "不了……大家都信你，BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000009
msgid ""
"Alright, fine then.\n"
"I've kinda gotten attached to the place myself."
msgstr ""
"好吧，随你。\n"
"我自己也有点喜欢上这地方了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x00000a
msgid "What about Amanda and her people?"
msgstr "阿曼达和她的人呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000001
msgid "...Snake!"
msgstr "……SNAKE！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000002
msgid "Can you hear me?"
msgstr "能听到吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000003
msgid "Si, I can hear you."
msgstr "是，听到了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000004
msgid "Where are you?"
msgstr "你在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000005
msgid "I am not sure. I don't recognize it."
msgstr "不确定。我不认识这。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000006
msgid "What about Coldman?"
msgstr "科尔德曼呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000007
msgid ""
"He just left for the control tower...\n"
"Said something about entering the final data."
msgstr ""
"他刚去管制塔了……\n"
"说是要输入最终数据。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000000
msgid "There's a skeleton crew manning the base."
msgstr "基地里只留了少数人值守。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000001
msgid ""
"Everyone else is enroute \n"
"to the base in Nicaragua."
msgstr ""
"其他人都正在前往\n"
"尼加拉瓜的基地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000002
msgid ""
"Snake, think you can make it \n"
"to that control tower?"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你能赶到\n"
"那座管制塔吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000003
msgid ""
"Not sure why, but this place is \n"
"crawling with Russian troops. "
msgstr ""
"不知为何，这里\n"
"到处都是俄军。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000004
msgid "Gonna have to force my way through."
msgstr "只能强行突破了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000005
msgid "What the hell's going on?"
msgstr "到底怎么回事？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000006
msgid "Damned if I know."
msgstr "不知道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000007
msgid ""
"Get over there quick as you can.\n"
"You're almost there, Snake. Stay steady!"
msgstr ""
"尽快赶过去。\n"
"就快到了，SNAKE，稳住！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000000
msgid "What is the matter?"
msgstr "怎么了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000001
msgid "They found me...!"
msgstr "他们发现我了……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000003
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eeb/0x000000
msgid "Kaz?"
msgstr "卡兹？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000004
msgid "Snake, you OK?"
msgstr "SNAKE，你没事吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000005
msgid "All MSF's ready to move out."
msgstr "MSF全员已准备出动。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000006
msgid "They're headed your way, on the double."
msgstr "他们正火速赶往你那边。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000007
msgid "Are you serious?"
msgstr "你说真的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000001
msgid "I'm coming, Paz."
msgstr "我来了，帕兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000002
msgid ""
"Do not worry about me... I am an angel of peace.\n"
"I will be watching over you."
msgstr ""
"别担心我……我是和平天使。\n"
"我会守护你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000003
msgid "Here goes nothing!"
msgstr "拼了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000001
msgid "Big Boss, you made it."
msgstr "BIG BOSS，你成功了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000002
msgid ""
"Too late, though. \n"
"The false data's already in place."
msgstr ""
"但太迟了。\n"
"假数据已经输入完毕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000003
msgid "False data?"
msgstr "假数据？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000004
msgid "That's right. Peace Walker is designed for deterrence - nothing more. "
msgstr "没错。和平行者只为威慑而造——仅此而已。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000005
msgid ""
"She is incapable of initiating \n"
"a nuclear attack on her own."
msgstr ""
"她无法自行\n"
"发动核攻击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000006
msgid ""
"She will only awaken and attack\n"
"when it's time to retaliate. "
msgstr ""
"她只会在需要报复时\n"
"才会觉醒并攻击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000007
msgid "Peace Walker is a weapon of peace, after all. "
msgstr "和平行者本就是和平的武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000008
msgid "First, we'll enter data for an imaginary Soviet nuclear strike on the U.S. homeland..."
msgstr "首先，输入苏联对美国本土发动核打击的假想数据……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000009
msgid "After assessing the data as a threat,"
msgstr "在将该数据判定为威胁后，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will automatically \n"
"enter retaliation mode,"
msgstr ""
"和平行者会自动\n"
"进入报复模式，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000b
msgid ""
"selecting the optimal target \n"
"from a pre-defined list... "
msgstr ""
"从预设列表中\n"
"选出最优目标……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000c
msgid ""
"For this scenario, we have \n"
"reverse engineered the false data "
msgstr ""
"为此，我们已对\n"
"虚假数据做了逆向处理，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000d
msgid ""
"so that she'll inevitably end up choosing\n"
"the Caribbean Sea as her target."
msgstr ""
"确保她最终必然选择\n"
"加勒比海作为目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000e
msgid "You're really gonna do it, aren't you?"
msgstr "你真要这么做吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Know this: Peace Walker's retaliation will be\n"
"the first and last of the Cold War."
msgstr ""
"记住：和平行者的报复将是\n"
"冷战的首次，也是最后一次。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000010
msgid ""
"It is the only way we will ever come close \n"
"to achieving true peace..."
msgstr ""
"这是我们唯一能接近\n"
"真正和平的途径……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000011
msgid "All that is left is to enter the code."
msgstr "剩下的就是输入密码了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000012
#: slot/0x0052801a/0x0a7cd6/0x000012
#: slot/0x00eeea4a/0x3d5434/0xdb6a29
msgid "No!"
msgstr "住手！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000013
msgid "Stand down, Big Boss."
msgstr "退下，BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000014
msgid "You're late."
msgstr "你来晚了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000015
msgid "...Professor?"
msgstr "……教授？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000016
msgid "Professor..."
msgstr "教授……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000017
msgid ""
"Yes, well... Taking over the base \n"
"took longer than expected."
msgstr ""
"是啊……接管基地\n"
"比预想的费时。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000019
msgid ""
"I brought the technology, \n"
"you provided the money and land. "
msgstr ""
"我出技术，\n"
"你出资金和土地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001a
msgid ""
"Tsentr alone could never have accomplished\n"
"so much in so little time."
msgstr ""
"单靠中心组织绝不可能\n"
"这么快取得如此成果。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001b
msgid "Zadornov, you backstabbing son of a...!"
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫，你这背信弃义的狗东西……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001c
msgid ""
"\"Backstabbing?\" Correct me if I'm wrong,\n"
"but were we not enemies all along?"
msgstr ""
"“叛徒？”我没记错的话，\n"
"我们不一直是敌人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001d
msgid ""
"Do you really think my comrades were working\n"
"for the Company?"
msgstr ""
"你真以为我的同志们\n"
"是在为那家公司卖命？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001e
msgid ""
"Do you truly think we'd faithfully serve a pack\n"
"of depraved capitalist dogs?"
msgstr ""
"你真以为我们会忠心侍奉\n"
"一群堕落的资本主义走狗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001f
msgid "What are you going to do?"
msgstr "你想干什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000020
msgid "Launch a nuke... Target: Cuba."
msgstr "发射核弹……目标：古巴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000021
msgid ""
"Have you lost your mind?!\n"
"What would you possibly gain?"
msgstr ""
"你疯了吗？！\n"
"你到底想得到什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000022
msgid "We won't be the ones launching it."
msgstr "发射的人不会是我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000023
msgid "You, the Americans, will attack our ally, Cuba."
msgstr "你们美国人会打我们盟友古巴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000024
msgid "WHAT?!"
msgstr "什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000025
msgid "Think, Coldman. We're on an American base, "
msgstr "想想吧，科尔德曼。我们在美国的基地里，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000026
msgid ""
"eagerly endorsed and supplied by \n"
"a pro-American regime."
msgstr ""
"由亲美政权\n"
"热切支持并提供。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000027
msgid "What's the international community to think?"
msgstr "国际社会会怎么想？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000028
msgid "The world will burn with anti-American sentiment! "
msgstr "全世界都会燃起反美情绪！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000029
msgid ""
"Communism will spread across \n"
"Latin America unchecked."
msgstr ""
"共产主义将肆无忌惮地\n"
"席卷拉丁美洲。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002a
msgid ""
"Let the age of deterrence be undone\n"
"by the deterrent itself... "
msgstr ""
"让威慑的时代被威慑本身\n"
"所终结……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002b
msgid "such is the Kremlin's plan."
msgstr "这就是克里姆林宫的计划。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002c
msgid "You son of a bitch..."
msgstr "你这混蛋……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002d
msgid "Paz, come here..."
msgstr "帕兹，过来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002e
msgid "Shoot him."
msgstr "杀了他。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002f
msgid "Professor Gálvez...?"
msgstr "加尔维斯教授……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000030
msgid "Hm... I am Vladimir Zadornov, "
msgstr "哼……我是弗拉基米尔·扎多尔诺夫，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000031
msgid ""
"and Vladimir means \"ruler of peace.\"\n"
"Now do as you're told, Paz."
msgstr ""
"弗拉基米尔意为“和平的统治者”。\n"
"照我说的做，帕兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000032
msgid "Don't do it..."
msgstr "别动手…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000033
msgid ""
"Remember what they did to you \n"
"at their base on the coast..."
msgstr ""
"想想他们在海岸基地\n"
"对你做了什么……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000034
msgid ""
"For what Coldman's done... \n"
"he deserves nothing less than death."
msgstr ""
"科尔德曼的所作所为……\n"
"他死不足惜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000035
msgid "Paz... I... I'm sorry..."
msgstr "帕兹…对不起…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000036
msgid "I can't..."
msgstr "我做不到……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000037
msgid "Truly a child of peace... "
msgstr "真是和平之子…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000038
msgid "No, wait!"
msgstr "不，等等！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000039
msgid ""
"Only fitting that retribution be delivered\n"
"by a \"dead hand.\""
msgstr ""
"由“死手”来执行报应，\n"
"再合适不过了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003a
msgid "You...you missed on purpose..."
msgstr "你……故意打偏……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Your part in this isn't done.\n"
"I need you to enter the code."
msgstr ""
"你的任务还没完。\n"
"我需要你输入密码。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003c
msgid ""
"Doctor, the target is now Cuba.\n"
"Please make the necessary modifications."
msgstr ""
"博士，目标现在是古巴。\n"
"请做必要的修改。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003d
msgid "And don't even think of resisting. "
msgstr "别想着反抗。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003e
msgid ""
"I'll crush you, but only after \n"
"I crush your \"beloved,\" first."
msgstr ""
"我会碾碎你，但前提是\n"
"先碾碎你的“挚爱”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003f
msgid "No, not that..."
msgstr "不，不是那个……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000040
msgid "Cuba is now the retaliation target."
msgstr "古巴现在是报复目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000041
msgid "...Very well."
msgstr "……好吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000042
msgid "Good. It is done. As for you, Big Boss..."
msgstr "很好。完成了。至于你，BIG BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000043
msgid "I've been watching you all along. "
msgstr "我一直在注视着你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000044
msgid "You've performed beyond even my highest expectations - a true comandante."
msgstr "你的表现甚至超出了我最高的期望——真正的指挥官。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000046
msgid "Why do you think I summoned you to Costa Rica, "
msgstr "你以为我为什么把你召到哥斯达黎加，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000047
msgid "had you make contact with the Sandinistas?"
msgstr "让你去接触桑地诺派？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000048
msgid ""
"A true intelligence operative \n"
"never gets his hands dirty. "
msgstr ""
"真正的情报人员\n"
"从不弄脏自己的手。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000049
msgid ""
"Need a revolution?\n"
"Manipulate the locals into doing it for you."
msgstr ""
"需要革命？\n"
"操纵当地人替你做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004a
msgid "You mean... Amanda?! And the Sandinistas...!"
msgstr "你是说……阿曼达？！还有桑地诺派……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004b
msgid ""
"You've done well.\n"
"You took a ragtag band of guerillas - children - "
msgstr ""
"你干得不错。\n"
"你把一群游击队员，孩子，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004c
msgid ""
"and shaped them into a full-fledged, \n"
"formidable army."
msgstr ""
"打造成了一支成熟、\n"
"令人生畏的军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004d
msgid ""
"And now, you'll truly become \"our century's\n"
"most complete human being\"!"
msgstr ""
"而现在，你将真正成为“我们世纪\n"
"最完整的人”！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004e
msgid "...Che Guevara?"
msgstr "……切·格瓦拉？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004f
msgid ""
"None other. A hero who, gunned down \n"
"by the CIA, becomes a legendary icon."
msgstr ""
"正是。一位被CIA枪杀，\n"
"成为传奇图标的英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000050
msgid ""
"The Sandinistas will rise up in revenge,\n"
"overthrowing the pro-American regime "
msgstr ""
"桑地诺派将奋起复仇，\n"
"推翻亲美国的政权，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000051
msgid "and wresting Nicaragua from U.S. hands. "
msgstr "从美国手中夺回尼加拉瓜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000052
msgid ""
"And the nuclear strike on Cuba, naturally,\n"
"will be the last straw."
msgstr ""
"而对古巴的核打击，自然，\n"
"将是最后一根稻草。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000053
msgid "Mammal Pod data entry is complete."
msgstr "哺乳舱数据输入完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000054
msgid "Dead at age 39... Just like El Che."
msgstr "39岁就死了……跟切一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000055
msgid "...Ironic, isn't it?"
msgstr "……真讽刺。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000056
msgid "In the end, a legend is merely fiction. "
msgstr "到头来，传奇不过是虚构。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000057
msgid ""
"You'll die as The Boss did and become, \n"
"as did she, an eternal fraud."
msgstr ""
"你会像THE BOSS那样死去，\n"
"和她一样，成永恒骗局。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000058
msgid "¡Venceremos!"
msgstr "必胜！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000059
#: slot/0x0048f045/0x0a7cd6/0x00001c
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4686bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4e8ebf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xb262bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xba6abf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xc2c774/0x000000
#: slot/0x00ce245c/0x0a7cd6/0x000008
#: slot/0x00ce245c/0x0a7cd6/0x00002a
msgid "Freeze!"
msgstr "不许动！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005a
msgid "You dare point your gun at a comrade?!"
msgstr "你敢拿枪指着同志？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005b
msgid ""
"We will not be pawns of the KGB.\n"
"We will win our own victory!"
msgstr ""
"我们不做克格勃棋子。\n"
"要赢自己的胜利！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005c
msgid "¡Hasta la victoria siempre!"
msgstr "直到永远胜利！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005e
msgid "We're home! Look, we're back in Nica!"
msgstr "回家了！看，回到尼加了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005f
msgid "We did it, Amand- I mean, comandante!"
msgstr "做到了，阿曼达，指挥官！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000060
msgid "Boss, you hurt...?"
msgstr "BOSS，你受伤了……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000061
msgid "I'm fine."
msgstr "我没事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000062
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000064
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000065
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000066
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000067
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000068
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000069
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00007d
msgid "Vic Boss!"
msgstr "VIC BOSS!"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000063
msgid "Vic Boss..."
msgstr "Vic Boss……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006a
msgid "You're a regular Joan of Arc."
msgstr "你简直是圣女贞德。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006b
msgid "Nonsense, you're the hero here."
msgstr "胡说，你才是英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006c
msgid "You saved my life. You're the heroes, here."
msgstr "你救了我的命。你们才是英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006d
msgid "Heh. I never figured you for a softie, Snake."
msgstr "呵。没想到你也心软，SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006e
msgid "Thanks. It's good to see you."
msgstr "谢谢。见到你真好。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006f
msgid "Paz can stay with us until she's back on her feet."
msgstr "帕兹可以留下养伤，直到康复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000070
msgid "And the \"professor\"?"
msgstr "那“教授”呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000071
msgid "We'll find him a nice, comfy cell."
msgstr "给他找个舒服牢房。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000072
msgid ""
"Coldman's lost a lot of blood. \n"
"He may not make it..."
msgstr ""
"科尔德曼失血过多。\n"
"他可能撑不住……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000073
msgid "Where's Amanda?"
msgstr "阿曼达呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000074
msgid "Back with her compas. She'll catch up later."
msgstr "带罗盘回来了。她随后赶上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000075
msgid "How about you, Snake...?"
msgstr "你呢，SNAKE……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000076
msgid "I'm not done yet."
msgstr "我还没完。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000077
msgid "The AI?"
msgstr "AI？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000078
msgid "I have to finish this."
msgstr "我得做个了结。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000079
msgid "That Boss is a fake. I'm gonna bury it."
msgstr "那BOSS是假的。我要埋了它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007a
msgid "We'll save the champagne until you get back."
msgstr "香槟留到你回来再开。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007b
msgid "May as well celebrate peace... while it lasts."
msgstr "不如趁和平还在……庆祝一下。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007c
msgid ""
"I didn't bring her back to life \n"
"because I was forced to."
msgstr ""
"我让她复活\n"
"不是因为我被迫这么做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007d
msgid ""
"I wanted to know how she really felt...\n"
"how it really ended."
msgstr ""
"我想知道她真正的感受……\n"
"真正的结局。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007e
msgid "The Boss is dead."
msgstr "BOSS死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007f
msgid "No, she's alive."
msgstr "不，她还活着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000080
msgid "Some truths are better left buried."
msgstr "有些真相还是埋着好。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000081
msgid ""
"You don't mean that. Be honest.\n"
"You want to know, too, don't you?"
msgstr ""
"你不是真心的。老实说吧。\n"
"你也想知道，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000082
msgid ""
"Whether what you saw and heard \n"
"at the end was the truth?"
msgstr ""
"你在最后看到和听到的\n"
"究竟是不是真相？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000083
msgid "She'll tell us. I know she will."
msgstr "她会说的。我知道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000084
msgid "Thank you for stopping them."
msgstr "谢谢你阻止了他们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000085
msgid "And... I'm sorry."
msgstr "还有……对不起。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000086
msgid "I can't imagine how it hurt."
msgstr "我无法想象多痛。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000087
msgid "...I'll live."
msgstr "……我死不了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000088
msgid "I'm used to shock therapy. "
msgstr "我习惯电击疗法了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000089
msgid "You are? Well... that's very kind of you to say."
msgstr "是吗？嗯……你这么说真是太好了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008a
msgid "Let's go meet her, shall we? Get in..."
msgstr "去见她吧，好吗？上车……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008b
msgid "...Boss."
msgstr "……BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008c
msgid ""
"Don't pick up a gun \n"
"unless you know how to use it."
msgstr ""
"不懂怎么用枪\n"
"就别捡枪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008d
msgid ""
"Aiming a weapon alone \n"
"doesn't make it a deterrent."
msgstr ""
"光靠瞄准武器\n"
"并不能构成威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008e
msgid "You're the angel of peace. Leave the guns to us."
msgstr "你是和平天使。枪交给我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008f
msgid "That was our agreement, remember?"
msgstr "这是约定，记得吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000090
msgid ""
"The army's leaving Costa Rica now.\n"
"The mission is complete."
msgstr ""
"军队现在撤离哥斯达黎加。\n"
"任务完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000091
msgid "Paz?"
msgstr "帕兹？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000092
msgid "...Thank you."
msgstr "……谢谢你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000093
msgid "...What's that noise?"
msgstr "……那是什么声音？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000094
msgid "What'd he do...?!"
msgstr "他干了什么……？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000095
msgid "I should have killed you when I had the chance!"
msgstr "我当初就该杀了你！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000096
msgid "...NORAD's nightmare is about to begin."
msgstr "……北美防空司令部的噩梦要开始了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000098
msgid ""
"Peace Walker... determines retaliation targets...\n"
"based on enemy nuclear strike data..."
msgstr ""
"和平行者……根据敌方核打击数据……\n"
"确定报复目标……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000099
msgid ""
"That data... can be sent... \n"
"to third parties, as well..."
msgstr ""
"那些数据……也能……\n"
"发送给第三方……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009a
msgid ""
"We got big problems, Snake.\n"
"Coldman's activated the nuclear launch switch!"
msgstr ""
"出大事了，SNAKE。\n"
"科尔德曼启动了核发射开关！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009b
msgid "What?! And the target's Cuba?"
msgstr "什么？！目标是古巴？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009c
msgid ""
"Yeah. But that's not it.\n"
"The son of a bitch has screwed us all over."
msgstr ""
"对。但不止如此。\n"
"那混蛋把我们全坑了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009d
msgid "When Peace Walker was activated,"
msgstr "和平行者启动后，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009e
msgid "it started transmitting the false data set"
msgstr "就开始把伪造数据"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009f
msgid "to NORAD."
msgstr "发送给北美防空司令部。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a0
msgid ""
"It's using a spread spectrum MLF\n"
" (multilength frequency) signal... "
msgstr ""
"它用的是扩频MLF\n"
"（多频）信号……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a1
msgid ""
"It can't be blacked out even by EMP\n"
"(electromagnetic pulse)."
msgstr ""
"连EMP\n"
"（电磁脉冲）都无法屏蔽。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a2
msgid "There's no way to tell the difference "
msgstr "根本无法分辨"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a3
msgid ""
"between false data and \n"
"the real thing on a radar screen."
msgstr ""
"雷达屏幕上的伪造数据\n"
"和真实数据。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a4
msgid ""
"NORAD will have no idea it's all a ruse \n"
"generated by Peace Walker."
msgstr ""
"北美防空不知道\n"
"这全是和平行者的假象。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a5
msgid "They'll think it's a real Soviet attack."
msgstr "他们会以为是苏联真打来了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a6
msgid ""
"They'll pass on the data to the National Military\n"
"Command Center... "
msgstr ""
"他们会把数据传给国家军事\n"
"指挥中心……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a7
msgid ""
"And Washington will have to choose \n"
"whether or not to retaliate."
msgstr ""
"华盛顿将不得不决定\n"
"是否进行报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a8
msgid ""
"This could get ugly! Unless we stop it,\n"
"we're looking at a retaliatory chain-reaction! "
msgstr ""
"这会变得很糟！除非我们阻止它，\n"
"否则将引发报复连锁反应！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000aa
msgid ""
"No need to panic. \n"
"The nightmare will end soon enough."
msgstr ""
"不必恐慌。\n"
"噩梦很快就会结束。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ac
msgid "Coldman's aim "
msgstr "科尔德曼的目的"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ad
msgid ""
"is for the bureaucrats in Washington to see\n"
"the importance of a machine"
msgstr ""
"是让华盛顿的官僚们看到\n"
"一种机器的重要性"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ae
msgid "like Peace Walker."
msgstr "比如和平行者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000af
msgid ""
"...He's trying to prove that humans \n"
"don't possess the will to launch nukes."
msgstr ""
"……他想证明人类\n"
"没有发射核弹的意志。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b0
msgid ""
"Everything will be fine. They'll never retaliate.\n"
"They're only human..."
msgstr ""
"一切都会没事。他们不会报复。\n"
"他们只是人类……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b1
msgid "Kaz, where's the President?"
msgstr "卡兹，总统在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b2
msgid ""
"...Last I heard he was in the middle of SALT II\n"
"negotiations in Vladivostok."
msgstr ""
"……我最后听说他在海参崴\n"
"参加第二阶段限武谈判。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b3
msgid "With the president gone, "
msgstr "总统不在，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b4
msgid "nuclear launch authority passes to the next person in the chain of succession."
msgstr "核发射权就移交给继任顺序中的下一个人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b5
msgid ""
"The Vice President's gone, too,\n"
"so after him comes the Speaker..."
msgstr ""
"副总统也不在，\n"
"所以接下来是众议院议长……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b6
msgid "...President, Vice President... "
msgstr "……总统、副总统……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b7
msgid ""
"Not one among them has \n"
"the courage to push the button. "
msgstr ""
"他们中没有一个人\n"
"有勇气按下按钮。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b8
msgid ""
"No one willing to enter history \n"
"as the Great Destroyer."
msgstr ""
"没人愿意以伟大毁灭者的身份\n"
"载入史册。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b9
msgid ""
"In the end, it's not their lives that \n"
"people value most... it's their reputations!"
msgstr ""
"说到底，人们最看重的不是自己的命……\n"
"而是自己的名声！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ba
msgid ""
"The bureaucrats in Washington \n"
"may not be able to retaliate. "
msgstr ""
"华盛顿的官僚们\n"
"也许无法进行报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bb
msgid "Peace Walker, on the other hand..."
msgstr "但和平行者就不同了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bc
msgid "She's loyal to the mission above all. "
msgstr "她忠于任务高于一切。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bd
msgid ""
"And she's well aware that \n"
"guaranteed retaliation is essential"
msgstr ""
"而且她很清楚，\n"
"确保报复能力至关重要，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000be
msgid "for nuclear deterrence to work."
msgstr "核威慑才能奏效。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bf
msgid "Peace Walker is the perfect deterrent."
msgstr "和平行者是完美的威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c0
msgid "Cuba would not have been my choice of targets... "
msgstr "古巴不会是我的目标选择……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c1
msgid ""
"but you can't make peace \n"
"without breaking a few eggs."
msgstr ""
"但想实现和平\n"
"总得打破几个鸡蛋。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c2
msgid ""
"Now that Peace Walker has the false data...\n"
"retaliation is inevitable."
msgstr ""
"如今和平行者已掌握假数据...\n"
"报复已不可避免。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c3
msgid "Are you insane? "
msgstr "你疯了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c4
msgid ""
"You think it'll end there?!\n"
"You're about to unleash all-out nuclear war!"
msgstr ""
"你以为这样就完了？！\n"
"你这是要引发全面核战争！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c5
msgid "Somebody find out what's going on at NORAD!"
msgstr "快查北美防空司令部怎么回事！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c6
msgid ""
"Mammal's got a connection to NORAD.\n"
"We could monitor it with the right equipment."
msgstr ""
"Mammal和北美防空司令部有连接。\n"
"有合适的设备就能监听。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c7
msgid "I've got you covered."
msgstr "交给我吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c8
msgid "I've got NORAD on the line."
msgstr "北美防空司令部接通了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c9
msgid "Sir, we're tracking unidentified targets."
msgstr "长官，我们追踪到不明目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ca
msgid "Current apogee 20 degrees. Estimated time of reentry is two-two-five-zero Zulu."
msgstr "当前远地点20度。预计再入时间22点50分祖鲁时间。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cb
msgid "Have you contacted the President?"
msgstr "联系上总统了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cc
msgid "Coverall is not responding."
msgstr "Coverall没有回应。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cd
msgid ""
"Warning system checks out.\n"
"No corresponding natural signatures. "
msgstr ""
"预警系统检查无误。\n"
"无对应自然信号。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ce
msgid "Data is assessed as reliable."
msgstr "数据评估为可靠。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cf
msgid ""
"Cut the data transmission! We can't say for sure\n"
"Washington isn't going to retaliate!"
msgstr ""
"切断数据传输！我们无法确定\n"
"华盛顿不会反击！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d0
msgid ""
"The only one who knows... \n"
"the abort code... is me..."
msgstr ""
"唯一知道...\n"
"中止密码的...只有我..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d1
msgid "I die... and no one can turn it off..."
msgstr "我一死...就没人能关了..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d2
msgid ""
"Even if they do strike back... \n"
"I'll already... be dead..."
msgstr ""
"就算他们真的反击...\n"
"我早就...死了..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d3
msgid ""
"I can only pray... that my theory... \n"
"my peace... is proven right..."
msgstr ""
"我只能祈祷...我的理论...\n"
"我的和平...是正确的..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d4
msgid "Pea..."
msgstr "和..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d5
msgid "...ce"
msgstr "...平"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d6
msgid "...Go to DEFCON 3."
msgstr "...进入三级战备状态。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d7
msgid "Get SAC on the phone."
msgstr "接通战略空军司令部。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d8
msgid ""
"This is Crystal Palace.\n"
"Standby for an emergency meeting."
msgstr ""
"这里是水晶宫。\n"
"准备召开紧急会议。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d9
msgid "...They're at DEFCON 3."
msgstr "...他们进入三级战备了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000da
msgid ""
"The false data and the nukes are \n"
"both coming from the same source... "
msgstr ""
"假数据和核弹\n"
"来自同一个源头..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000db
msgid "we have to stop Peace Walker!"
msgstr "必须阻止和平行者！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000dc
msgid "The only way is to destroy her."
msgstr "只能摧毁她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000dd
msgid "She's entered launch mode. Peace Walker's rendered her judgment. The target is Cuba!"
msgstr "她已进入发射模式。和平行者已做出判断。目标是古巴！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000de
msgid "Snake, don't let it launch the nuke!"
msgstr "SNAKE，别让它发射核弹！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000000
msgid ""
"It stopped moving... Snake, you did it.\n"
"You stopped the launch!"
msgstr ""
"它停止移动了……SNAKE，你做到了。\n"
"你阻止了发射！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000001
msgid "Huey, how's NORAD?!"
msgstr "休伊，北美防空司令部那边怎么样？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000002
msgid "Not good... "
msgstr "不太好……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000003
msgid "BMEWS continues to track the targets on radar."
msgstr "BMEWS仍在雷达追踪目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000004
msgid ""
"DSP satellite status is green.\n"
"Still assessing as reliable."
msgstr ""
"国防支援卫星状态正常。\n"
"仍判定为可靠。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000005
msgid ""
"Chairman of the Joint Chiefs, \n"
"a representative of the Secretary of Defense, "
msgstr ""
"参谋长联席会议主席、\n"
"国防部长代表，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000006
msgid "and Congress have arrived at NMCC."
msgstr "国会已抵达NMCC。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000007
msgid ""
"You've only damaged the drive system...\n"
"The data uplink's still intact..."
msgstr ""
"你只破坏了驱动系统……\n"
"数据上行链路仍然完好……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000008
msgid ""
"We've got 1,500 Soviet ICBMs \n"
"crossing the North Pole. "
msgstr ""
"1500枚苏联洲际导弹\n"
"正穿越北极。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000009
msgid ""
"Target region is confirmed as the west coast\n"
"of the United States."
msgstr ""
"目标区域确认为美国西海岸\n"
"。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000a
msgid "Go to DEFCON 2. Prepare to launch ICBMs."
msgstr "进入二级戒备。准备发射洲际弹道导弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000b
msgid "How do I make it stop?!"
msgstr "怎么让它停？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000c
msgid "Peace Walker is a fully autonomous system."
msgstr "和平行者是完全自主的系统。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000d
msgid "Unlike the other machines you've fought, "
msgstr "与你打过的其他机器不同，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000e
msgid ""
"its command authorities are all located inside\n"
"its cerebrum, the Mammal Pod."
msgstr ""
"它的指挥权限全部位于\n"
"其大脑——哺乳舱内部。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000f
msgid "We've got to stop the Mammal Pod...!"
msgstr "我们必须阻止哺乳舱……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000010
msgid ""
"I don't have the abort code either.\n"
"Coldman was the only one..."
msgstr ""
"我也没有中止代码。\n"
"只有科尔德曼有……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000011
msgid "Snake, destroy the AI inside the Mammal Pod!"
msgstr "SNAKE，摧毁哺乳舱里的AI！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000012
msgid "The inner barrier protecting the Mammal Pod "
msgstr "保护哺乳舱的内层屏障"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000013
msgid "is designed to be as strong as a bomb shelter."
msgstr "被设计得如同防空洞一般坚固。"
